<title>LITHUANIA: C.BANK CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 19.</title>
<headline>C.BANK CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 19.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, March 19 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    19.03.97     18.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.3556	 6.3936</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3648	 2.3628</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5808	 4.5790</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2481	 3.2428</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5170	 0.5167</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7860	 0.7907</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2957	 0.2952</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8794	 6.8770</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7010	 0.7014</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2979	 1.2987</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas,  Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
